// ELEC2645 games console main file.
// This file sets up the board, shows the intro screens, then hands control to
// the shared menu. Each game keeps its own loop and returns here when it exits.

// Custom palette guide used by the shared screens and games.
// 0  = black      
// 1  = white       
// 2  = baby blue    
// 3  = brown     
// 4  = camel tan   
// 5  = camel nose 
// 6  = pale cream  
// 7  = light pink   
// 8  = lavender     
// 9  = grey         
// 10 = sage green   
// 11 = red
// 12 = green
// 13 = blue
// 14 = yellow
// 15 = orange

